(6895108, 1039048, 138630, '<td valign="top">A beautiful combination of softness and sharp detail, glow and color pop.  One of my top two. Voted earlier.</td>', 'A beautiful combination of softness and sharp detail, glow and color pop.  One of my top two. Voted earlier.', '2012-10-31 22:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6895109, 1038942, 138630, '<td valign="top">Stunning clarity, light and color - slickly and well done.  One of my top two.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Stunning clarity, light and color - slickly and well done.  One of my top two.  Voted earlier.', '2012-10-31 22:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6895110, 1038375, 138630, '<td valign="top">The light, color and lines are beautiful but it''s the drop that does it.  You could hear it drop.  Top five for me.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'The light, color and lines are beautiful but it''s the drop that does it.  You could hear it drop.  Top five for me.  Voted earlier.', '2012-10-31 22:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6895111, 1039011, 94815, '<td valign="top">Big quiet space. 6</td>', 'Big quiet space. 6', '2012-10-31 22:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6895112, 1038990, 138630, '<td valign="top">Lots of cemetery images in the theme - appropriately as they are silent in more than one way.  But this was the most poignant, not only because of the inclusion of the woman but especially because of her pose and expression.  I can sense her silent ache.  Top five for me.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Lots of cemetery images in the theme - appropriately as they are silent in more than one way.  But this was the most poignant, not only because of the inclusion of the woman but especially because of her pose and expression.  I can sense her silent ache.  Top five for me.  Voted earlier.', '2012-10-31 22:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6895114, 1038617, 138630, '<td valign="top">Just bumped this earlier tonight.  It''s a great idea and may be a real portrait but it feels staged so I resisted quite awhile.  Top five because it''s a lovely portrait and fits the challenge so well.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Just bumped this earlier tonight.  It''s a great idea and may be a real portrait but it feels staged so I resisted quite awhile.  Top five because it''s a lovely portrait and fits the challenge so well.  Voted earlier.', '2012-10-31 22:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6895115, 1039047, 138630, '<td valign="top">Sound that is no longer and never will be again.  <br/>So sad.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Sound that is no longer and never will be again.  So sad.  Voted earlier.', '2012-10-31 22:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6895116, 1039051, 138630, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the cemetery only images - richly colored and stately.  I like the formal feel to this place that is emphasized by your perspective.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'My favorite of the cemetery only images - richly colored and stately.  I like the formal feel to this place that is emphasized by your perspective.  Voted earlier.', '2012-10-31 22:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6895117, 1038861, 94815, '<td valign="top">Aha! Ethereally beautiful landscape as viewed on an old TV screen. What a concept! 8 for the shot. Demerits for the concept.</td>', 'Aha! Ethereally beautiful landscape as viewed on an old TV screen. What a concept! 8 for the shot. Demerits for the concept.', '2012-10-31 22:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6895120, 1038236, 138630, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in the challenge.  I love the wet pavement, the composition, the title :)  Well done.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'One of my favorites in the challenge.  I love the wet pavement, the composition, the title :)  Well done.  Voted earlier.', '2012-10-31 23:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6895121, 1038149, 138630, '<td valign="top">Nothing quite as sad as a doll that has lost its child.  No more giggles or soothing coos.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Nothing quite as sad as a doll that has lost its child.  No more giggles or soothing coos.  Voted earlier.', '2012-10-31 23:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6895122, 1038861, 138630, '<td valign="top">Lovely tonal range and ambiance here - the still of the night.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Lovely tonal range and ambiance here - the still of the night.  Voted earlier.', '2012-10-31 23:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6895123, 1038829, 138630, '<td valign="top">Nothing says silence quite as well as simplicity - this should do very well.  It''s lovely.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Nothing says silence quite as well as simplicity - this should do very well.  It''s lovely.  Voted earlier.', '2012-10-31 23:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6895224, 1038843, 127021, '<td valign="top">personally this image is the best in the challenge because it connects with me... maybe it''s because it was an idea i''d tossed around (i didn''t enter)... either way I think this is one of the few ways of transmitting the feeling of silence: a scream cut short by the fact that it''s a photograph.  technically speaking, I think there are several things that could be done to improve the image, but overall I think it does what it''s supposed to.  great job</td>', 'personally this image is the best in the challenge because it connects with me... maybe it''s because it was an idea i''d tossed around (i didn''t enter)... either way I think this is one of the few ways of transmitting the feeling of silence: a scream cut short by the fact that it''s a photograph.  technically speaking, I think there are several things that could be done to improve the image, but overall I think it does what it''s supposed to.  great job', '2012-11-01 04:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6895225, 1038980, 127021, '<td valign="top">well shot, well edited, and a good pick for subject matter.  one of my top picks.</td>', 'well shot, well edited, and a good pick for subject matter.  one of my top picks.', '2012-11-01 04:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6895226, 1038829, 127021, '<td valign="top">a bit too much like the "zen" challenge, but this was one of the few images that made me feel "silence" upon viewing; great work.</td>', 'a bit too much like the "zen" challenge, but this was one of the few images that made me feel "silence" upon viewing; great work.', '2012-11-01 04:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6895228, 1039068, 127021, '<td valign="top">a good idea, obviously, and also executed very well... I''m still on the fence about whether the zipper should be open or not.</td>', 'a good idea, obviously, and also executed very well... I''m still on the fence about whether the zipper should be open or not.', '2012-11-01 05:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6895310, 1039072, 138630, '<td valign="top">Actually my favorite of the images with someone with a finger (or something else) over their lips which is funny as I ordinarily am not drawn to a photograph of a piece of art.  But having the full context makes a huge difference as does the conversion to black and white which makes this larger view a work in its own right.  Initially thought I''d have lost that corner and bit of furniture on the left, but I''ve re-thought that.  I like the letterbox here, too.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Actually my favorite of the images with someone with a finger (or something else) over their lips which is funny as I ordinarily am not drawn to a photograph of a piece of art.  But having the full context makes a huge difference as does the conversion to black and white which makes this larger view a work in its own right.  Initially thought I''d have lost that corner and bit of furniture on the left, but I''ve re-thought that.  I like the letterbox here, too.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-01 08:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6895315, 1038605, 138630, '<td valign="top">The single, hanging seed adds a lot to this delicate macro as does the title which emphasizes the feeling of stillness that goes with the silence here.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'The single, hanging seed adds a lot to this delicate macro as does the title which emphasizes the feeling of stillness that goes with the silence here.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-01 08:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6895318, 1038964, 138630, '<td valign="top">Clever, sharp, and punchy.  I have certainly felt like doing just this when the alarm went off some mornings.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Clever, sharp, and punchy.  I have certainly felt like doing just this when the alarm went off some mornings.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-01 08:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6895320, 1038853, 138630, '<td valign="top">I like the darkness of this very early dawn image.  The figure adds but I''m not as sure about his pose and position in the frame.  The reflection which shows more separation between his legs helps.  Just musing - nice clarity.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'I like the darkness of this very early dawn image.  The figure adds but I''m not as sure about his pose and position in the frame.  The reflection which shows more separation between his legs helps.  Just musing - nice clarity.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-01 08:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6895322, 1038988, 138630, '<td valign="top">Autumn is a beautiful time of year for this old cemetery - there is dignity in the formality of the framing here and I like that.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Autumn is a beautiful time of year for this old cemetery - there is dignity in the formality of the framing here and I like that.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-01 08:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6895324, 1038962, 138630, '<td valign="top">The light and tones are spectacular - would be better if the cars were not there, I think - or just one would have been cool.  I look forward to reading other comments - bet others have a completely different take on them.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'The light and tones are spectacular - would be better if the cars were not there, I think - or just one would have been cool.  I look forward to reading other comments - bet others have a completely different take on them.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-01 08:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6895325, 1039069, 138630, '<td valign="top">A beautiful almost abstract - I love the softness here that really adds to the feeling of quiet.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'A beautiful almost abstract - I love the softness here that really adds to the feeling of quiet.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-01 09:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6895329, 1039034, 138630, '<td valign="top">Spectacular sky - for light, color, composition.  This one is really playing with my mind as I try to figure out that second sun.  That side of the image almost looks like a combination of vertical and horizontal flip - is it reflected or a result of the lens or natural?  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Spectacular sky - for light, color, composition.  This one is really playing with my mind as I try to figure out that second sun.  That side of the image almost looks like a combination of vertical and horizontal flip - is it reflected or a result of the lens or natural?  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-01 09:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6895330, 1038145, 138630, '<td valign="top">This simple, Zen set-up is just right for the challenge.  Love the touch of green.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'This simple, Zen set-up is just right for the challenge.  Love the touch of green.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-01 09:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6895332, 1039059, 138630, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape - low-lying clouds and a mountain backdrop always work well together.  I like the light dusting of snow in the foreground.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Nice landscape - low-lying clouds and a mountain backdrop always work well together.  I like the light dusting of snow in the foreground.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-01 09:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6895337, 1039035, 138630, '<td valign="top">I had a similar entry - mine was a sunflower and lacked those marvelous web threads and the lovely curling shapes of your petals (it was a sunflower center so pretty heavy looking), but it was in sepia, too.  This is what I was going for and didn''t get.  Feels very still and quiet to me.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'I had a similar entry - mine was a sunflower and lacked those marvelous web threads and the lovely curling shapes of your petals (it was a sunflower center so pretty heavy looking), but it was in sepia, too.  This is what I was going for and didn''t get.  Feels very still and quiet to me.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-01 09:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6895341, 1038134, 138630, '<td valign="top">The shapes of the fabric remind me of wings - very graceful.  Not so sure about the leg and foot - there''s something about the harsher lighting, centered position and pronounced veins that contradict the mood of airiness and silence in the rest of the image and makes it not quite right for the challenge.  Still a nice score from me.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'The shapes of the fabric remind me of wings - very graceful.  Not so sure about the leg and foot - there''s something about the harsher lighting, centered position and pronounced veins that contradict the mood of airiness and silence in the rest of the image and makes it not quite right for the challenge.  Still a nice score from me.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-01 09:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6895490, 1038859, 100831, '<td valign="top">Awesome - so full of emotion and form - all huddled together.</td>', 'Awesome - so full of emotion and form - all huddled together.', '2012-11-01 12:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6895491, 1039052, 100831, '<td valign="top">pretty!</td>', 'pretty!', '2012-11-01 12:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6895492, 1039020, 100831, '<td valign="top">lovely scene.. a compositional beauty.</td>', 'lovely scene.. a compositional beauty.', '2012-11-01 12:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6895494, 1038236, 100831, '<td valign="top">softly stepping through the reflection... wonderful.</td>', 'softly stepping through the reflection... wonderful.', '2012-11-01 12:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6895496, 1038843, 144365, '<td valign="top">#1.<br/>In a challenge filled with very little interesting, this one stands out. Of 90 images, there''s maybe six I really like. This one just happened to be number 1. <br/> <br/>Even though the picture is of someone screaming, for some reason the editing gives me the sensation they''re in a vacuum, and thus no noise could be heard no matter how hard they try.</td>', '#1.In a challenge filled with very little interesting, this one stands out. Of 90 images, there''s maybe six I really like. This one just happened to be number 1.  Even though the picture is of someone screaming, for some reason the editing gives me the sensation they''re in a vacuum, and thus no noise could be heard no matter how hard they try.', '2012-11-01 12:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6895499, 1038859, 144365, '<td valign="top">#2, tied with another.<br/>I don''t get this photo. I don''t even know if I like it. Just gave it my second highest vote because I''m starting to reward different images. I want to give incentive to people who attempt different things so I''m not stuck gauging my eyes out at the endless derivative and lifeless entries challenge after challenge. <br/> <br/>You''re very hit and miss with me Minso, which is a good thing. At least you make me think.</td>', '#2, tied with another.I don''t get this photo. I don''t even know if I like it. Just gave it my second highest vote because I''m starting to reward different images. I want to give incentive to people who attempt different things so I''m not stuck gauging my eyes out at the endless derivative and lifeless entries challenge after challenge.  You''re very hit and miss with me Minso, which is a good thing. At least you make me think.', '2012-11-01 13:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6895504, 1038149, 144365, '<td valign="top">#2, tied with another. <br/>Why would you store a doll head in a jar? Someone is watching too much Futurama.<br/> <br/>I find this image intriguing. Something you''d hand on a wall to get the conversation started. I might have pushed the blues a little more in the eyes, for a bit more pop, but otherwise I really like this image.</td>', '#2, tied with another. Why would you store a doll head in a jar? Someone is watching too much Futurama. I find this image intriguing. Something you''d hand on a wall to get the conversation started. I might have pushed the blues a little more in the eyes, for a bit more pop, but otherwise I really like this image.', '2012-11-01 13:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6895578, 1038984, 57447, '<td valign="top">I can barely hear the grass blowing in the wind.  Well done!</td>', 'I can barely hear the grass blowing in the wind.  Well done!', '2012-11-01 14:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6895580, 1038854, 57447, '<td valign="top">Muffled silence.</td>', 'Muffled silence.', '2012-11-01 15:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6895581, 1038964, 57447, '<td valign="top">Yeah...thanks!</td>', 'Yeah...thanks!', '2012-11-01 15:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
