(6896275, 1038138, 138630, '<td valign="top">I gave it a 6 - kind of the average between the "impact" score of 3 I would have given it based on originality and interest and the "technique" score of 9 I would have given it based on the lighting and processing.  I think <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=96751" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tanguera</a> is right - it''s very well done and just right for the challenge or for illustrating silence in another context.</td>', 'I gave it a 6 - kind of the average between the "impact" score of 3 I would have given it based on originality and interest and the "technique" score of 9 I would have given it based on the lighting and processing.  I think  tanguera is right - it''s very well done and just right for the challenge or for illustrating silence in another context.', '2012-11-02 10:03:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(6896290, 1038980, 112739, '<td valign="top">Christophe, Congrats on winning yet again, and with a score that is below your overall average! Question for you- did you use a neutral ND filter for the horizon separation or just a standard ND filter? Or no filter at night?</td>', 'Christophe, Congrats on winning yet again, and with a score that is below your overall average! Question for you- did you use a neutral ND filter for the horizon separation or just a standard ND filter? Or no filter at night?', '2012-11-02 10:25:29.000000', NULL, 0),
