(6896324, 1038060, 91496, '<td valign="top">I can only assume such a low score is from the "you took a picture on someone else''s art" crowd.  I like the way you cropped the angel.  Nice lighting and shadows.  Slightly out of focus on the eyes may also have hurt you here.  The DOF is great just needed to move the focus point a bit.</td>', 'I can only assume such a low score is from the "you took a picture on someone else''s art" crowd.  I like the way you cropped the angel.  Nice lighting and shadows.  Slightly out of focus on the eyes may also have hurt you here.  The DOF is great just needed to move the focus point a bit.', '2012-11-02 11:43:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(6896325, 1039041, 96751, '<td valign="top">Been trying to squeak out an 6 myself for weeks now! Glad to see you did. Warm tones to this.</td>', 'Been trying to squeak out an 6 myself for weeks now! Glad to see you did. Warm tones to this.', '2012-11-02 11:44:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(6896328, 1038859, 96751, '<td valign="top">A perfect 6. And all that bling! Congrats, Joshua. Great image.</td>', 'A perfect 6. And all that bling! Congrats, Joshua. Great image.', '2012-11-02 11:45:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(6896330, 1039035, 96751, '<td valign="top">Happy to see others appreciated this as well.</td>', 'Happy to see others appreciated this as well.', '2012-11-02 11:47:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(6896331, 1038964, 49511, '<td valign="top">nice idea but very ''clean'' and horrific colors, still a 5</td>', 'nice idea but very ''clean'' and horrific colors, still a 5', '2012-11-02 11:48:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(6896332, 1039038, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the noise/grunge affect, but the white vignette/border was so over the top that it became the center of interest, rather then the photo itself.</td>', 'I like the noise/grunge affect, but the white vignette/border was so over the top that it became the center of interest, rather then the photo itself.', '2012-11-02 11:48:24.000000', NULL, 0),
