(6896515, 1038980, 114969, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by digifotojo:</b></div><hr/><i> Nice image but definitely not best in show... which makes me wonder. hmmm Congrats for pulling this off. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you. "Best" is subjective, sometimes it is hard to foresee how the various opinions will merge together. But thanks for letting me know yours.</td>', 'Originally posted by digifotojo: Nice image but definitely not best in show... which makes me wonder. hmmm Congrats for pulling this off.   Thank you. "Best" is subjective, sometimes it is hard to foresee how the various opinions will merge together. But thanks for letting me know yours.', '2012-11-02 15:19:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(6896528, 1039069, 30861, '<td valign="top">From my perspective, this was Best of Show and my highest score given. Fabulous, ethereal image. Congrats on your first ribbon!</td>', 'From my perspective, this was Best of Show and my highest score given. Fabulous, ethereal image. Congrats on your first ribbon!', '2012-11-02 15:42:44.000000', NULL, 0),
