(6896574, 1038960, 68503, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments.<br/> <br/>@albrix I tried to crop it out but it took to much away from the lower clouds. Plus it was a last minute entry a didnt have to much time to get anything else. It is definitely just an average shot but the reflection coming off the lower level of clouds was so intense Im disappointed my cheapo camera couldnt pick it all up.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments. @albrix I tried to crop it out but it took to much away from the lower clouds. Plus it was a last minute entry a didnt have to much time to get anything else. It is definitely just an average shot but the reflection coming off the lower level of clouds was so intense Im disappointed my cheapo camera couldnt pick it all up.', '2012-11-02 17:27:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(6896584, 1038962, 35545, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light and color.</td>', 'Beautiful light and color.', '2012-11-02 17:41:36.000000', NULL, 0),
