(6896596, 1039047, 138630, '<td valign="top">Such a very nice entry - subtle, as Bear said.  Subtle was what was called for.  Congratulations on the HM.</td>', 'Such a very nice entry - subtle, as Bear said.  Subtle was what was called for.  Congratulations on the HM.', '2012-11-02 18:02:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(6896597, 1038861, 138630, '<td valign="top">Oh, I definitely think the black and white was the way to go for the challenge.  Just a lovely image.  Congratulations on the HM.</td>', 'Oh, I definitely think the black and white was the way to go for the challenge.  Just a lovely image.  Congratulations on the HM.', '2012-11-02 18:03:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(6896599, 1038145, 138630, '<td valign="top">Love the green, hate the green - you never know LOL.  Very peaceful and perfect in its simplicity of composition and execution.  Congratulations on the top ten.</td>', 'Love the green, hate the green - you never know LOL.  Very peaceful and perfect in its simplicity of composition and execution.  Congratulations on the top ten.', '2012-11-02 18:04:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(6896600, 1039072, 138630, '<td valign="top">WTG, Paul.  Terrific capture - deserved the placement in my opinion (and obviously in that of many other voters).  Congratulations on the top ten.</td>', 'WTG, Paul.  Terrific capture - deserved the placement in my opinion (and obviously in that of many other voters).  Congratulations on the top ten.', '2012-11-02 18:08:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(6896601, 1038149, 138630, '<td valign="top">I love it when something like the reflections that result from shooting through glass not only do not distract but also enhance an image - such is the case here as this image as thanks to the tones, reflections, and dirt, this has an appropriately vintage feel.  Very effective.  Congratulations on the top ten.</td>', 'I love it when something like the reflections that result from shooting through glass not only do not distract but also enhance an image - such is the case here as this image as thanks to the tones, reflections, and dirt, this has an appropriately vintage feel.  Very effective.  Congratulations on the top ten.', '2012-11-02 18:10:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(6896603, 1038617, 138630, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the top ten.  Beautifully taken.</td>', 'Congratulations on the top ten.  Beautifully taken.', '2012-11-02 18:11:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(6896606, 1039044, 138630, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the top ten.  Great colors - quiet but shimmery.</td>', 'Congratulations on the top ten.  Great colors - quiet but shimmery.', '2012-11-02 18:11:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(6896611, 1039048, 138630, '<td valign="top">When I saw the placement of this beautiful image, my first response was "well, I sure got that wrong".  Then I looked again and I said, "Nope.  Everyone else did."  Congratulations on a beautiful image and nice to see a couple of others appreciate it as much as I do.</td>', 'When I saw the placement of this beautiful image, my first response was "well, I sure got that wrong".  Then I looked again and I said, "Nope.  Everyone else did."  Congratulations on a beautiful image and nice to see a couple of others appreciate it as much as I do.', '2012-11-02 18:15:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(6896613, 1038942, 138630, '<td valign="top">Perhaps too boldly colored for the challenge as many seem to think Silence must be faded or at the very least pastel.  But I could not deny the simplicity and clarity of this one.  Beautifully done.</td>', 'Perhaps too boldly colored for the challenge as many seem to think Silence must be faded or at the very least pastel.  But I could not deny the simplicity and clarity of this one.  Beautifully done.', '2012-11-02 18:17:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(6896635, 1038829, 98339, '<td valign="top">Judi...this is stunning...very, very well done...congrats on the ribbon...</td>', 'Judi...this is stunning...very, very well done...congrats on the ribbon...', '2012-11-02 18:51:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(6896636, 1038861, 98339, '<td valign="top">beautiful Neil...well done...top 5 in two challenges...you must be golden!!!</td>', 'beautiful Neil...well done...top 5 in two challenges...you must be golden!!!', '2012-11-02 18:52:44.000000', NULL, 0),
