(6896729, 1038060, 3216, '<td valign="top">I agree that the off-focus hurt the score - A LOT! i was too lazy to re-take the shot, just cropped and used what i shot earlier. The tight crop revealed the focus offset that was not apparent in the full image.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-11-02 23:29:32.</i></td>', 'I agree that the off-focus hurt the score - A LOT! i was too lazy to re-take the shot, just cropped and used what i shot earlier. The tight crop revealed the focus offset that was not apparent in the full image.', '2012-11-02 22:04:25.000000', '2012-11-02 23:29:32.000000', 0),
